      "content": "it's just that \"strength\" you're talking about... it feels more like a prison sentence. like i'm just prolonging something that shouldn't even be this hard. it feels like the world is just fundamentally built to exclude me, and no matter how much i \"survive,\" i'm still just a ghost living in a shell. it's just so much weight.",
